WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:43.010
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.280 --> 01:44.640
Where are we going now, Brother Biao?

3
01:45.879 --> 01:46.400
East Street.

4
01:58.000 --> 01:58.760
Target's heading to East Street.

5
01:59.000 --> 02:00.120
Xiao Ding, pull up East Street.

6
02:00.280 --> 02:00.640
On it.

7
02:00.640 --> 02:01.239
All units, be advised.

8
02:01.560 --> 02:02.719
The suspect is heading toward East Street.

9
02:02.840 --> 02:03.280
Move in.

10
02:09.120 --> 02:10.479
We're behind the suspect vehicle.

11
02:10.560 --> 02:12.800
About 50 meters behind the suspect.

12
02:14.039 --> 02:15.759
That Mazda behind us is catching up.

13
02:22.960 --> 02:24.080
Turn at the intersection ahead.

14
02:25.439 --> 02:25.800
Copy that.

15
02:26.719 --> 02:27.800
Suspect vehicle, a Mazda,

16
02:27.840 --> 02:29.719
plate Chang D24653, is now behind us.

17
02:29.840 --> 02:31.759
We'll break off pursuit on the road ahead,

18
02:34.479 --> 02:37.159
and enter East Street via Roman Avenue.

19
02:54.599 --> 02:55.360
Dongfeng Bridge.

20
02:57.479 --> 02:59.000
Brother Biao, something's off.

21
03:00.159 --> 03:01.719
That car's been tailing us the whole way.

22
03:02.240 --> 03:03.719
Could the cops be onto us?

23
03:13.400 --> 03:14.960
Can you tell your people

24
03:15.120 --> 03:16.319
to hang back a little?

25
03:16.599 --> 03:18.199
Don't scare off our client.

26
03:22.240 --> 03:23.919
Brother Biao, who is it?

27
03:24.960 --> 03:25.919
You'll know when we get there.

28
03:47.960 --> 03:49.280
Taking Guanghua Avenue now,

29
03:49.599 --> 03:50.800
coming out from Yinshi Road.

30
04:24.800 --> 04:25.240
Captain Bai.

31
04:25.639 --> 04:27.199
The suspect circled south from Dongcheng,

32
04:27.360 --> 04:28.480
and is now heading back north.

33
04:35.600 --> 04:37.279
Captain Bai, we're on the Mazda now.

34
04:37.480 --> 04:39.160
Approaching Weiyuan Avenue and Hongyou Road.

35
04:40.600 --> 04:42.000
Once they hit Weiyuan Bridge,

36
04:42.000 --> 04:43.199
they'll be heading out of town.

37
04:45.399 --> 04:47.800
I don't have time to play games with you.

38
04:48.000 --> 04:49.560
Tell me where the deal is right now!

39
04:49.759 --> 04:51.160
Once you get to Changshan Dam,

40
04:51.360 --> 04:52.879
you'll see the goods soon enough.

41
04:55.639 --> 04:56.720
Head to Changshan Dam.

42
05:09.199 --> 05:10.079
Pull up Changshan Dam.

43
05:10.399 --> 05:10.800
Copy that.

44
05:26.920 --> 05:27.759
The road to Changshan Dam

45
05:28.519 --> 05:30.040
is completely deserted.

46
05:31.000 --> 05:33.439
Plus, the dam area is wide open.

47
05:34.439 --> 05:35.759
Once our team moves in,

48
05:36.480 --> 05:37.199
we'll be spotted easily.

49
05:39.439 --> 05:40.120
Li Qiang's men

50
05:40.120 --> 05:41.720
should already be near the dam by now.

51
05:42.120 --> 05:43.360
And we don't have time

52
05:43.360 --> 05:44.160
to deploy in advance.

53
05:44.439 --> 05:46.800
Right now, besides Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang,

54
05:47.560 --> 05:49.000
there's that crew in the Mazda.

55
05:50.360 --> 05:51.879
If the guy in that Mazda

56
05:52.639 --> 05:53.839
is Four-Legged Snake,

57
05:54.319 --> 05:56.279
he must've cut a deal with Liang Wenbiao

58
05:56.839 --> 05:58.879
to kick Li Qiang while he's down.

59
06:00.160 --> 06:01.319
You mean

60
06:02.160 --> 06:03.120
he plans to hijack the shipment?

61
06:07.600 --> 06:09.040
But the location Li Qiang arranged

62
06:09.040 --> 06:10.879
is just as difficult for Liang Wenbiao

63
06:11.160 --> 06:12.160
and Four-Legged Snake.

64
06:12.519 --> 06:14.920
Besides, if he sees that Liang Wenbiao

65
06:15.000 --> 06:16.319
brought anyone else along,

66
06:16.720 --> 06:18.319
he could call off the deal at any moment.

67
06:19.560 --> 06:20.279
Notify Captain Shen.

68
06:21.160 --> 06:23.120
Set up roadblocks outbound from Changshan Dam.

69
06:23.399 --> 06:24.759
We'll deploy on the fly

70
06:25.240 --> 06:26.079
based on the Mazda's movements.

71
06:26.839 --> 06:28.519
Calling CID, calling CID.

72
06:41.079 --> 06:43.519
Boss, it's right up ahead.

73
06:50.000 --> 06:50.879
Listen up.

74
06:52.000 --> 06:52.959
Once we get the goods,

75
06:53.519 --> 06:54.959
don't let that punk get away.

76
06:55.279 --> 06:55.839
Brother Biao,

77
06:56.560 --> 06:57.480
what do you mean?

78
06:58.040 --> 07:00.040
Aren't we... aren't we here to make a deal?

79
07:01.160 --> 07:02.439
Didn't I tell you already?

80
07:02.639 --> 07:03.720
I want to make an extra cut.

81
07:05.040 --> 07:08.079
Besides, that punk Li Qiang should've died long ago.

82
07:09.160 --> 07:11.120
Trying to take me down comes with a price.

83
07:32.319 --> 07:33.319
After driving around for so long,

84
07:34.000 --> 07:35.399
I thought they'd pick somewhere special.

85
07:36.160 --> 07:37.000
Just this dump?

86
07:38.920 --> 07:41.240
Don't stop yet. Circle around a couple of times.

87
08:19.160 --> 08:19.920
Brother Qiang.

88
08:20.600 --> 08:22.959
You sure kept me waiting forever.

89
08:23.800 --> 08:25.120
Good things take time, right?

90
08:25.639 --> 08:26.720
Brother Biao doesn't strike me

91
08:26.720 --> 08:28.079
as the impatient type.

92
08:28.560 --> 08:29.600
I'm not impatient.

93
08:29.920 --> 08:32.080
Just haven't seen you in so long,

94
08:32.279 --> 08:33.519
I really missed you.

95
08:39.559 --> 08:40.279
Hurry it up.

96
08:40.480 --> 08:41.799
Don't keep Brother Biao waiting.

97
08:43.919 --> 08:44.399
Got it.

98
08:52.679 --> 08:54.679
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang are making the deal now.

99
08:55.679 --> 08:57.279
The Mazda has reached the reed field,

100
08:57.559 --> 08:59.360
about one kilometer from the scene.

101
08:59.840 --> 09:01.320
Team B has eyes on them.

102
09:02.159 --> 09:03.759
Team A is at the intersection ahead,

103
09:04.360 --> 09:05.159
covering the outbound route.

104
09:05.960 --> 09:08.039
The CID has set up roadblocks as well.

105
09:09.279 --> 09:10.279
Right now, all the suspects

106
09:10.279 --> 09:11.559
are within our perimeter.

107
09:11.759 --> 09:13.240
Tell everyone to hold their positions.

108
09:13.480 --> 09:14.360
Wait for word from Team B.

109
09:14.679 --> 09:15.039
Copy that.

110
10:30.360 --> 10:30.840
Brother Biao.

111
10:34.120 --> 10:35.159
What's this supposed to mean?

112
10:43.399 --> 10:44.480
I don't want your life.

113
10:44.879 --> 10:47.840
But I want both the cash and the goods.

114
10:56.679 --> 10:57.279
How about this?

115
10:58.240 --> 10:59.440
Give me the cash and the goods,

116
10:59.960 --> 11:01.600
and leave your life here too.

117
11:03.360 --> 11:04.559
Have you lost your mind?

118
11:17.759 --> 11:18.639
It's an ambush!

119
11:21.440 --> 11:22.000
Brother Biao!

120
11:37.000 --> 11:37.480
All units,

121
11:37.879 --> 11:38.279
move in.

122
11:52.879 --> 11:53.440
Brother Biao!

123
11:59.440 --> 12:00.559
The cops are here!

124
12:33.879 --> 12:34.799
Ah Wei!

125
12:36.360 --> 12:37.120
Ah Wei!

126
13:00.720 --> 13:02.679
B-Brother Biao's always suspected you.

127
13:03.600 --> 13:03.960
He...

128
13:05.000 --> 13:05.360
He...

129
13:06.080 --> 13:07.159
He told me to tail you.

130
13:10.399 --> 13:13.000
I know your... your sister

131
13:14.080 --> 13:15.559
has been in Nanhai City all along.

132
13:16.840 --> 13:17.200
But...

133
13:20.120 --> 13:22.240
But I didn't... didn't tell Brother Biao.

134
13:31.360 --> 13:32.639
Forget him, let's get out of here!

135
13:33.720 --> 13:34.360
Go!

136
13:34.519 --> 13:35.919
We're out of time!

137
13:35.919 --> 13:37.279
Hurry! Go!

138
13:40.320 --> 13:40.720
Go!

139
13:42.039 --> 13:42.559
Drive!

140
14:06.639 --> 14:08.440
Pursue them. I'll have CID back you up.

141
14:08.679 --> 14:09.639
The suspect is crucial.

142
14:09.639 --> 14:11.039
Do not fire unless absolutely necessary.

143
14:11.159 --> 14:11.840
I want him alive.

144
14:11.840 --> 14:12.200
Yes, sir.

145
14:12.480 --> 14:12.960
Get in!

146
14:33.759 --> 14:34.559
Provide cover!

147
14:34.759 --> 14:35.639
The rest of you, follow me.

148
14:47.840 --> 14:48.440
Freeze!

149
14:48.639 --> 14:49.639
Go, hurry!

150
14:53.039 --> 14:53.639
Wendi!

151
14:55.639 --> 14:56.639
Brother Qiang, go!

152
14:57.279 --> 14:58.720
We're running out of time!

153
14:58.919 --> 14:59.600
Just go!

154
15:00.759 --> 15:01.279
Wendi!

155
15:01.759 --> 15:02.559
Wendi!

156
15:05.639 --> 15:06.399
Go!

157
15:57.480 --> 15:58.960
The cops could catch up any second.

158
15:59.039 --> 16:00.360
You won't make it through this alone.

159
16:00.399 --> 16:01.200
Cops?

160
16:01.799 --> 16:03.919
How do I know you aren't a cop?

161
16:05.399 --> 16:06.519
You're Four-Legged Snake, Brother Si, right?

162
16:07.840 --> 16:08.679
I'm with Liang Wenbiao.

163
16:09.000 --> 16:10.799
Since you're working with Liang Wenbiao,

164
16:11.120 --> 16:12.519
you ought to know who his men are.

165
16:14.600 --> 16:15.879
Liang Wenbiao told me

166
16:16.200 --> 16:18.080
there might be a mole among his men.

167
16:18.399 --> 16:20.279
How do I know it isn't you?

168
16:21.399 --> 16:23.399
The mole in Brother Biao's crew was Chen Kang.

169
16:24.000 --> 16:24.799
I took him out.

170
16:26.080 --> 16:27.360
For today's deal...

171
16:28.360 --> 16:30.320
The cops showed up so fast,

172
16:30.320 --> 16:31.840
which means they came prepared.

173
16:31.960 --> 16:34.559
Someone definitely tipped them off.

174
16:34.960 --> 16:36.159
Just now, like you,

175
16:36.559 --> 16:38.320
I fought my way out through a hail of police bullets.

176
16:38.320 --> 16:40.200
You ever seen a cop risk his life like that?

177
16:40.519 --> 16:41.200
Not necessarily.

178
16:41.440 --> 16:43.159
Plenty of cops aren't afraid to die.

179
16:58.799 --> 17:00.000
You two, head to the hospital.

180
17:00.399 --> 17:01.600
Guard the suspects around the clock.

181
17:01.840 --> 17:02.360
Yes, sir.

182
17:08.279 --> 17:08.680
Captain Bai.

183
17:09.240 --> 17:10.759
Five criminals were killed at the scene.

184
17:11.200 --> 17:12.319
Mai Wendi, Liang Wenbiao,

185
17:12.359 --> 17:14.440
and two unidentified individuals were severely injured,

186
17:14.519 --> 17:15.200
in critical condition.

187
17:15.480 --> 17:16.839
No casualties among our officers.

188
17:27.799 --> 17:28.519
Where is Tian Xin?

189
17:29.039 --> 17:29.759
Where is Tian Xin?

190
17:30.720 --> 17:31.400
Talk!

191
17:31.920 --> 17:33.279
Where is Tian Xin? - Li Xiao, don't be reckless!

192
17:33.480 --> 17:34.160
Talk!

193
17:34.160 --> 17:35.480
Where is Tian Xin? - Calm down!

194
17:35.480 --> 17:36.079
Don't be reckless!

195
17:36.119 --> 17:37.079
If he dies now... - I'm asking you!

196
17:37.079 --> 17:38.559
...we'll never find Tian Xin.

197
17:45.160 --> 17:45.880
Li Xiao!

198
17:46.200 --> 17:46.880
Let him go.

199
17:48.599 --> 17:49.599
We're about to catch up to them.

200
17:49.799 --> 17:50.400
Captain Bai said...

201
17:50.559 --> 17:51.359
...not to follow too closely.

202
17:51.680 --> 17:53.559
The CID has set up roadblocks ahead.

203
17:53.759 --> 17:54.559
The suspects won't get away.

204
18:00.039 --> 18:00.480
Captain Shen.

205
18:01.559 --> 18:03.319
Two suspects are fleeing out of the city.

206
18:03.839 --> 18:05.440
Requesting two vehicles to intercept them.

207
18:06.079 --> 18:07.079
These suspects are crucial.

208
18:07.599 --> 18:08.519
Make sure to take them alive.

209
18:08.839 --> 18:09.559
Copy that. Copy that.

210
18:10.799 --> 18:11.279
Let's go.

211
18:13.119 --> 18:14.279
Everyone into the cars, move out!

212
18:14.559 --> 18:15.200
Get in!

213
18:36.519 --> 18:37.640
The highway entrance is just ahead.

214
18:37.960 --> 18:38.920
The cops must've set up a roadblock.

215
18:39.519 --> 18:40.319
We're not getting away.

216
18:40.480 --> 18:42.279
You're not thinking of surrendering, are you?

217
18:48.279 --> 18:48.720
Slow down!

218
18:48.799 --> 18:49.759
The cops are catching up!

219
18:49.759 --> 18:51.759
I told you to slow down! Did you hear me?!

220
18:51.920 --> 18:52.720
Slow down!

221
18:57.880 --> 18:58.440
Watch out!

222
19:00.920 --> 19:02.559
You wanna chase me? Keep chasing!

223
19:05.559 --> 19:06.759
Stop the car! Hurry, stop!

224
19:06.960 --> 19:07.559
Stop the car!

225
19:29.119 --> 19:29.680
Cops!

226
19:31.759 --> 19:32.359
Ram through!

227
19:32.480 --> 19:33.720
If we ram through, we'll all die!

228
19:34.559 --> 19:35.160
Stop the car!

229
19:35.200 --> 19:36.480
I said ram through, so ram through!

230
19:36.640 --> 19:37.279
Ram through!

231
19:37.599 --> 19:38.240
Stop the car!

232
19:38.599 --> 19:39.400
Stop the car!

233
19:45.319 --> 19:45.839
Hold on!

234
19:46.440 --> 19:46.920
Stop the car!

235
20:08.359 --> 20:09.160
Everyone, spread out and search.

236
20:47.920 --> 20:48.559
Are you dead?

237
20:49.400 --> 20:51.559
Are... are you dead?

238
20:52.799 --> 20:53.400
Good, you're still alive.

239
20:57.160 --> 20:57.640
Get out of the car.

240
20:58.039 --> 20:59.200
The cops are almost here.

241
20:59.839 --> 21:00.400
Move!

242
21:01.160 --> 21:01.920
Get out!

243
21:02.440 --> 21:03.000
Move!

244
21:11.279 --> 21:12.480
Over here, quick!

245
21:46.000 --> 21:46.359
Come here.

246
21:51.640 --> 21:52.119
Stop the car.

247
21:57.920 --> 21:58.200
Get out.

248
22:05.440 --> 22:05.640
Get in.

249
22:09.240 --> 22:09.839
Get in!

250
22:21.839 --> 22:22.240
Drive.

251
22:42.799 --> 22:43.799
Everyone, split up and keep searching.

252
23:04.240 --> 23:04.519
Get out of the car.

253
23:12.519 --> 23:14.200
Brother Si, who were they?

254
23:15.400 --> 23:16.680
Could be our own people.

255
23:18.400 --> 23:19.720
Or maybe the cops.

256
23:21.279 --> 23:22.680
I'll stay at your place for a few days.

257
23:23.319 --> 23:23.960
As for this kid...

258
23:24.160 --> 23:25.079
let's take him back first.

259
23:42.079 --> 23:43.079
In today's operation,

260
23:43.279 --> 23:45.599
we arrested drug dealers Liang Wenbiao, Mai Wendi, and others.

261
23:46.000 --> 23:47.519
Five criminals were shot dead on the scene.

262
23:48.359 --> 23:50.599
Because the suspects changed the deal location last minute,

263
23:50.920 --> 23:52.279
our understanding of the pursuit scene

264
23:52.279 --> 23:53.200
was limited.

265
23:53.799 --> 23:55.680
So Li Qiang managed to escape again.

266
23:56.039 --> 23:59.200
Another unidentified suspect

267
23:59.680 --> 24:00.880
took Wei Kai hostage and escaped.

268
24:02.480 --> 24:05.200
Li Qiang holds the lives of Zhuang Yan, Ge Dan,

269
24:05.359 --> 24:06.759
and Tian Xin in his hands.

270
24:07.119 --> 24:08.240
His escape this time

271
24:08.799 --> 24:10.240
serves as a wake-up call for us.

272
24:11.319 --> 24:12.440
Step up the citywide manhunt.

273
24:12.720 --> 24:14.160
Bring Li Qiang to justice as soon as possible.

274
24:14.680 --> 24:16.880
Meanwhile, notify our officers at the hospital

275
24:17.079 --> 24:18.480
to keep a close eye on the suspects.

276
24:18.839 --> 24:20.400
Once they're out of critical condition,

277
24:20.519 --> 24:21.599
interrogate them immediately.

278
24:22.279 --> 24:23.960
Try to get from Mai Wendi

279
24:24.079 --> 24:25.160
the whereabouts of Li Qiang

280
24:25.359 --> 24:26.039
so we can locate Tian Xin.

281
24:26.319 --> 24:26.720
Yes, sir.

282
24:27.079 --> 24:29.720
Also, confirm as soon as possible whether the one holding Wei Kai

283
24:29.839 --> 24:30.880
is Four-Legged Snake.

284
24:31.599 --> 24:33.319
According to our prior intelligence,

285
24:33.599 --> 24:35.599
those teaming up with Liang Wenbiao against Li Qiang

286
24:35.680 --> 24:36.920
are Four-Legged Snake's crew.

287
24:43.119 --> 24:43.920
It's CID on the line.

288
24:47.640 --> 24:48.480
Bring him in right away.

289
24:50.640 --> 24:52.000
An hour ago, someone called the police

290
24:52.440 --> 24:54.519
reporting a carjacking on Canglong Road,

291
24:54.640 --> 24:55.680
right along the suspects' escape route.

292
24:56.160 --> 24:57.759
Our team is bringing the driver here right now.

293
25:01.759 --> 25:02.920
Have you reached Wei Kai yet?

294
25:04.400 --> 25:04.799
No.

295
25:06.000 --> 25:07.240
That's what worries me the most.

296
25:07.799 --> 25:10.160
The suspect took Wei Kai hostage

297
25:10.400 --> 25:12.200
most likely because they suspected his identity.

298
25:13.119 --> 25:15.640
So Wei Kai must be in serious danger right now.

299
26:02.640 --> 26:04.640
If it weren't for me, you'd have already...

300
27:12.680 --> 27:13.039
Sit down.

301
27:20.240 --> 27:20.559
Brother Si.

302
27:21.119 --> 27:22.440
How are you still in the mood to watch TV

303
27:25.480 --> 27:26.279
after something this big?

304
27:27.000 --> 27:28.160
Let's see what the police have to say.

305
27:33.920 --> 27:34.559
Talk to me.

306
27:35.079 --> 27:37.079
How do you know Liang Wenbiao?

307
27:38.079 --> 27:39.200
I beat him up.

308
27:39.880 --> 27:40.799
That's how we met.

309
27:42.920 --> 27:45.319
Sounds just like Liang Wenbiao.

310
27:45.680 --> 27:47.359
Always doing things the hard way.

311
27:51.000 --> 27:53.160
I told Liang Wenbiao before

312
27:53.279 --> 27:55.160
never to mention his dealings with me.

313
27:55.720 --> 27:57.079
How did you find out?

314
27:58.960 --> 27:59.599
Just a hunch.

315
28:01.960 --> 28:06.359
Then you must've guessed what I do, too.

316
28:09.079 --> 28:10.519
You're Brother Biao's supplier.

317
28:11.519 --> 28:13.880
He gets all his goods from you, right?

318
28:19.599 --> 28:22.200
I sent Liang Wenbiao's men to collect the cash.

319
28:23.599 --> 28:24.680
Were you in on that?

320
28:27.799 --> 28:29.039
Right after they went for the money,

321
28:29.039 --> 28:30.920
the cops raided our hideout.

322
28:32.079 --> 28:33.920
Which means among Liang Wenbiao's men,

323
28:34.960 --> 28:36.119
there's an undercover cop.

324
28:37.519 --> 28:39.319
I think it was just a coincidence.

325
28:39.960 --> 28:40.720
Though...

326
28:41.519 --> 28:43.640
Chen Kang, who was with us, was a cop.

327
28:44.839 --> 28:47.799
Didn't you say you'd already whacked him?

328
28:48.000 --> 28:49.599
We now bring you a police bulletin.

329
28:49.799 --> 28:51.079
At 10:00 a.m. today,

330
28:51.359 --> 28:54.160
Nanhai police launched a major anti-drug operation.

331
28:54.519 --> 28:55.480
During the operation,

332
28:55.640 --> 28:57.640
police shot and killed several drug traffickers,

333
28:57.640 --> 28:59.799
seizing 18 kilograms of narcotics,

334
29:00.039 --> 29:01.559
marking a significant victory.

335
29:02.079 --> 29:02.960
Unfortunately,

336
29:03.200 --> 29:04.759
a police officer

337
29:04.759 --> 29:06.119
embedded undercover in the syndicate

338
29:06.279 --> 29:07.640
was killed in the line of duty.

339
29:08.559 --> 29:10.839
We pay our highest respects

340
29:10.920 --> 29:12.960
to this unsung hero.

341
29:12.960 --> 29:16.200
Additionally, three suspects escaped during the raid,

342
29:16.200 --> 29:18.839
including key wanted fugitive Li Qiang.

343
29:19.200 --> 29:21.119
Police urge all citizens to stay alert...

344
29:21.200 --> 29:21.720
Brother Si,

345
29:23.160 --> 29:25.160
this kid doesn't look like a cop.

346
29:29.480 --> 29:31.440
You've got serious skills, kid.

347
29:31.799 --> 29:34.599
Why run with a useless bum like Liang Wenbiao?

348
29:35.839 --> 29:36.599
For money.

349
29:38.279 --> 29:40.599
Since you know he's useless,

350
29:41.000 --> 29:42.480
why work with him?

351
29:49.039 --> 29:49.400
Gao Jian.

352
29:51.440 --> 29:52.920
Go check the hospital.

353
29:53.319 --> 29:56.319
See if Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang's two men

354
29:56.799 --> 29:58.039
are actually dead.

355
29:58.920 --> 29:59.279
Got it.

356
30:06.119 --> 30:08.640
You two, keep your eyes on this kid.

357
30:08.880 --> 30:09.880
If he steps out of line,

358
30:10.079 --> 30:11.079
take him out.

359
30:11.680 --> 30:12.079
Understood.

360
32:09.400 --> 32:10.279
I'll go get the doctor.

361
33:06.559 --> 33:08.680
Boring. You win again.

362
33:12.400 --> 33:13.400
Something's up.

363
33:13.799 --> 33:14.440
Hurry up, move!

364
34:18.960 --> 34:20.239
Stop it! Stop it!

365
34:20.880 --> 34:22.239
Stop! Let go!

366
34:23.360 --> 34:25.360
Let him go! Let him go!

367
34:51.480 --> 34:52.360
What is wrong with you guys?

368
34:53.280 --> 34:54.679
I told you to teach Gu Xiaoyi a lesson,

369
34:55.199 --> 34:56.360
but instead, you made her call the police!

370
34:57.760 --> 34:59.559
We thought scaring her would be enough.

371
34:59.880 --> 35:01.199
Who knew she'd fight back so fiercely?

372
35:01.800 --> 35:03.119
And then some busybody had to butt in.

373
35:05.199 --> 35:06.119
I acted too hastily.

374
35:07.360 --> 35:08.960
I shouldn't have sent you in so soon.

375
35:16.119 --> 35:17.199
Looks like Nanhai City

376
35:18.400 --> 35:20.360
is really in for a heavy storm.

377
35:23.000 --> 35:25.119
How much does Gu Xiaoyi know about our business?

378
35:25.760 --> 35:26.960
If she keeps digging like this,

379
35:27.760 --> 35:30.559
Longze Group will end up on the police's radar sooner or later.

380
35:31.960 --> 35:33.039
Still, what worries me most right now

381
35:33.039 --> 35:34.159
isn't Gu Xiaoyi.

382
35:35.280 --> 35:38.199
Guo Yingying and Zhang Xuebin may be dead,

383
35:39.199 --> 35:41.400
but the police must have

384
35:41.400 --> 35:42.760
noticed Zhongtian Logistics long ago.

385
35:44.079 --> 35:45.639
The boss wants to sacrifice pawns to save the king,

386
35:46.039 --> 35:46.960
but the deaths of those two

387
35:46.960 --> 35:48.599
won't protect us at all.

388
35:49.719 --> 35:52.079
You think the cops will trace it back to us?

389
36:00.480 --> 36:01.880
I'm starting to suspect

390
36:02.320 --> 36:03.480
that in the boss's eyes,

391
36:04.000 --> 36:05.880
just like Qian Feng and the others,

392
36:07.159 --> 36:08.480
I'm nothing more than a pawn.

393
36:08.679 --> 36:10.320
If I can't clean this mess up properly,

394
36:11.320 --> 36:12.920
I'll end up just like them.

395
36:15.599 --> 36:17.119
Four-Legged Snake can barely save himself now.

396
36:17.559 --> 36:18.880
I can only rely on you.

397
36:20.440 --> 36:21.800
Just say the word. What do you need me to do?

398
36:24.960 --> 36:27.880
I need you to deliver a letter to someone for me.

399
36:33.760 --> 36:36.719
Last night, Longze Group's new CFO,

400
36:36.719 --> 36:39.280
Gu Xiaoyi, reported that she was assaulted.

401
36:39.480 --> 36:40.760
According to her statement,

402
36:40.880 --> 36:42.639
we suspect Hu Dong and others

403
36:42.639 --> 36:43.920
from Longze Group's security team.

404
36:44.159 --> 36:45.239
The mastermind behind it

405
36:45.679 --> 36:48.320
is Chen Hai, the former CFO of Longze Group.

406
36:51.400 --> 36:52.559
What are the grounds for suspecting him?

407
36:53.519 --> 36:54.400
Gu Xiaoyi stated that

408
36:54.920 --> 36:56.880
at the request of Longze Group's chairman,

409
36:56.880 --> 36:57.920
Long Zhiyuan,

410
36:58.280 --> 36:59.559
she had conducted an audit into

411
36:59.719 --> 37:00.519
the group's financial issues.

412
37:01.079 --> 37:02.159
She discovered that

413
37:02.360 --> 37:04.599
Runze Commerce, a subsidiary of Longze Group,

414
37:04.840 --> 37:06.079
has major financial irregularities.

415
37:06.719 --> 37:08.239
She even suspects that Chen Hai

416
37:08.519 --> 37:09.960
has been using Longze Group

417
37:10.119 --> 37:11.840
for illegal money laundering.

418
37:15.800 --> 37:17.280
Gu Xiaoyi said that last week,

419
37:17.440 --> 37:18.960
she confronted Chen Hai about this.

420
37:19.280 --> 37:20.719
Chen Hai threatened her on the spot,

421
37:20.880 --> 37:22.079
telling her to mind her own business.

422
37:22.920 --> 37:24.039
I believe Chen Hai

423
37:24.599 --> 37:25.960
is finally feeling the heat.

424
37:29.800 --> 37:31.840
Bring Chen Hai and Hu Dong in for questioning right away.

425
37:32.599 --> 37:33.000
Yes, sir.

426
37:33.519 --> 37:35.280
Bring them in for questioning

427
37:35.679 --> 37:36.400
to feel them out first

428
37:36.599 --> 37:38.039
and see if we can find any cracks.

429
37:38.800 --> 37:39.199
Understood.

430
37:44.559 --> 37:45.000
Hello.

431
37:46.119 --> 37:47.239
Hello, we're from the police department.

432
37:47.400 --> 37:48.519
Is Chen Hai in?

433
37:50.559 --> 37:51.039
Director Jiang.

434
37:54.199 --> 37:56.679
Can I help you with something?

435
37:57.360 --> 37:58.400
We'd like Mr. Chen Hai

436
37:58.559 --> 37:59.719
to come with us to assist in an investigation.

437
38:00.920 --> 38:03.119
Could you tell me what this is regarding?

438
38:03.280 --> 38:04.119
And you are?

439
38:04.679 --> 38:06.400
I'm the executive director of Longze Group.

440
38:06.519 --> 38:07.280
Hello.

441
38:07.760 --> 38:09.400
The matter is currently under investigation,

442
38:09.480 --> 38:10.440
so we cannot disclose any details.

443
38:10.960 --> 38:12.639
Also, please inform

444
38:12.800 --> 38:13.679
Hu Dong from your security team.

445
38:13.800 --> 38:15.000
He needs to come with us as well.

446
38:15.119 --> 38:15.599
All right.

447
38:15.840 --> 38:16.320
In addition,

448
38:16.320 --> 38:17.760
two of our officers will stay behind

449
38:17.920 --> 38:19.440
to question everyone on the security team.

450
38:20.480 --> 38:21.320
How about this?

451
38:21.800 --> 38:23.480
You can head straight to the security office.

452
38:23.880 --> 38:25.960
I'll have the deputy head gather everyone

453
38:26.519 --> 38:27.519
to cooperate with your investigation.

454
38:27.840 --> 38:28.440
Um...

455
38:29.320 --> 38:31.480
Director Jiang, Hu Dong took the day off today.

456
38:31.480 --> 38:33.719
He said family business came up and he'd be gone a few days.

457
38:34.000 --> 38:34.519
He took leave?

458
38:35.760 --> 38:36.559
So, officers...

459
38:37.360 --> 38:38.280
Is Chen Hai here, then?

460
38:38.760 --> 38:39.119
Yes.

461
38:39.559 --> 38:40.199
He's in his office.

462
38:41.480 --> 38:42.360
Take them there.

463
38:42.559 --> 38:42.920
Yes, sir.

464
38:43.119 --> 38:43.880
This way, please.

465
38:55.440 --> 38:55.760
Come in.

466
38:57.000 --> 38:58.199
Mr. Chen, someone's here to see you.

467
38:58.320 --> 38:58.679
All right.

468
39:02.320 --> 39:02.800
Hello.

469
39:03.960 --> 39:05.559
Are you Mr. Chen Hai?

470
39:06.000 --> 39:06.440
Yes, that's me.

471
39:07.840 --> 39:08.920
We're from the Municipal Public Security Bureau.

472
39:09.079 --> 39:10.119
Please come with us

473
39:10.280 --> 39:11.079
to assist with our investigation.

474
40:06.199 --> 40:08.119
If I'd known you were a cop from the start,

475
40:11.639 --> 40:13.480
nothing ever would've started between us.

476
40:20.960 --> 40:22.800
But what am I supposed to do now?

477
40:31.360 --> 40:33.599
I can't convince myself to stop loving you,

478
40:36.599 --> 40:39.639
and I certainly can't convince you to stop being a cop.

479
40:56.360 --> 40:57.559
Can you promise me,

480
40:58.800 --> 41:00.079
no matter where you are in the future,

481
41:02.280 --> 41:03.960
whenever I need you,

482
41:05.280 --> 41:06.840
you'll be by my side?

483
41:09.000 --> 41:09.840
Can you do that?

484
41:25.760 --> 41:26.239
Captain.

485
41:26.639 --> 41:27.960
Zhao Ming brought Chen Hai in.

486
41:29.000 --> 41:29.519
Where's Hu Dong?

487
41:30.239 --> 41:31.800
Supposedly took leave to go home.

488
41:31.960 --> 41:32.760
Went home?

489
41:33.840 --> 41:34.519
Where's his hometown?

490
41:35.360 --> 41:36.960
Records show Shanxi.

491
41:40.079 --> 41:41.719
Gu Xiaoyi reported being threatened.

492
41:42.199 --> 41:44.119
Hu Dong's probably afraid we'll question him.

493
41:52.559 --> 41:53.800
Gu Xiaoyi's case is minor.

494
41:55.440 --> 41:56.760
It can't be because of that.

495
41:59.039 --> 42:00.519
CID searched Hu Dong's dorm

496
42:00.519 --> 42:02.239
and collected his trace evidence.

497
42:02.519 --> 42:04.400
Later, along with samples from the other guards,

498
42:04.400 --> 42:05.519
it'll be sent over to forensics.

499
42:17.519 --> 42:18.800
Ding Tao, come in for a second.

500
42:23.800 --> 42:25.159
Let's dig into Chen Hai's background first.

501
42:32.679 --> 42:33.719
Captain Bai, you wanted to see me?

502
42:34.960 --> 42:35.960
Look into something for me.

503
42:36.599 --> 42:37.920
Longze Group's security team.

504
42:38.119 --> 42:39.159
Get the background files on everyone.

505
42:39.159 --> 42:39.599
Yes, sir.

506
42:52.280 --> 42:53.719
Where were you the night before last?

507
42:55.000 --> 42:56.920
I stayed at home the entire night,

508
42:57.559 --> 42:58.639
watching TV with my wife.

509
43:00.239 --> 43:01.280
Then do you know

510
43:01.440 --> 43:03.119
where this Hu Dong went that night?

511
43:05.159 --> 43:06.360
I know Hu Dong,

512
43:06.559 --> 43:07.519
but we aren't close.

513
43:07.679 --> 43:09.800
He wouldn't tell me where he goes.

514
43:11.280 --> 43:12.800
Looks like Chen Hai came prepared.

515
43:16.480 --> 43:18.320
Contact the police in Shanxi.

516
43:18.519 --> 43:20.239
Have them check Hu Dong's hometown

517
43:20.559 --> 43:22.840
to see if he really went back.

518
43:23.280 --> 43:24.000
Right away.

519
43:28.079 --> 43:28.519
Captain Lu.

520
43:28.960 --> 43:30.119
Ask him about the drugs.

521
43:33.000 --> 43:33.960
Do you know Qian Feng?

522
43:35.079 --> 43:35.679
Yes.

523
43:36.519 --> 43:37.639
We've had meals together,

524
43:38.159 --> 43:39.239
but we're not that close.

525
43:40.719 --> 43:41.239
Not close?

526
43:43.840 --> 43:44.679
You worked together.

527
43:45.480 --> 43:46.719
You must be mistaken.

528
43:47.079 --> 43:48.960
Qian Feng doesn't even work for Longze.

529
43:54.280 --> 43:55.360
On suspicion of drug trafficking,

530
43:55.360 --> 43:56.320
Qian Feng has already been arrested.

531
43:56.880 --> 43:57.679
And according to his confession,

532
43:58.440 --> 43:59.480
you're his supplier.
